spice
* Operational Amplifier Circuit
* Nodes: 1=Vo, 2=v-, 3=vout, 6=ground, 5=intermediate

R1 2 6 R1_value
R2 2 3 R2_value
R 2 5 R_value
L 5 6 L_value
L_1 2 6 L_value

* Op-amp connections
* Negative terminal of Op-amp connected to node 2
* Positive terminal connected to ground (node 6)
* Output of Op-amp is node 3

V1 6 3 0
